Title: "Positive Int"
Id: "0f143f4c-b9cc-46c2-805c-be6f01e2633e"

Text: "A `positive:` group with a `int:` section records the `positive integer` classification.

```mlg-fragment
[positive.integer]
positive:
int:
is: \"positive integer\"
```

These groups are open-text metadata. The heading is optional and, when present, is a label header."
Id: "5bc91064-bc2b-4660-9f2d-a949490258e4"
